<p>NOTE - AvtoVAZ includes Lada, Niva and Samara brands.</p>
<p>Daewoo FSL includes Lublin and Zuk brands. Daewoo FSO includes</p>
<p>Polonez brand. Fuji includes Subaru brand. GAZ (Gorkovsky</p>
<p>Avtomobilny Zavod) includes Gazelle and Volga brands. Moskvich</p>
<p>(formerly AZLK) includes Aleko brand. Perusahaan includes</p>
<p>Proton brand. Skoda Plzen includes Beta brand. Others for</p>
<p>General Motors include Cadillac, Chevrolet and Pontiac brands.</p>
<p>Data reflect retail sales which Reuters calculated from</p>
<p>provisional information provided by various sources, including</p>
<p>automakers and their importers as well as government statistics</p>
<p>bureaus and vehicle industry associations.</p>
<p>Totals for 1996 include revisions from previous surveys.</p>
